              <td height="63"> 
                <div align="center"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b>Dennis 
                  Ross is no wise elder statesman <br>
                  <font size="4">time for full disclosure by media about <br>
                  their guests and writers</font></b></font></div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
